<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sistem Dalam Pemeliharaan</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-900 text-white min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4">
    <div class="max-w-md w-full text-center bg-slate-800/80 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-700 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md">
        <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6 border border-amber-500/30 animate-pulse">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-screws-wrench text-3xl"></i>
        </div>
        
        <h1 class="text-xl font-extrabold tracking-wide text-amber-400 mb-2 uppercase">Sistem Dalam Perbaikan</h1>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Mohon maaf atas ketidaknyamanannya. Aplikasi presensi saat ini sedang dalam pemeliharaan rutin/peningkatan sistem. Silakan coba beberapa saat lagi.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-700 flex justify-center gap-3">
            <button onclick="location.reload()" class="bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-600 text-slate-950 font-bold text-xs px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-right"></i> Cek Ulang
            </button>
            <a href="/login" class="bg-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-600 text-slate-200 font-semibold text-xs px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl transition flex items-center gap-2">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-user-shield"></i> Login Admin
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
